OL,3,AOregon teacher fought school attacker
OL,4,Abefore armed dad shot suspect 'multiple
OL,5,Atimes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bystander, a father of two girls at
OL,8,Fthe school, had been driving past
OL,9,FSilver Rail Elementary in Bend at
OL,10,Flunchtime on Thursday when he saw the
OL,11,Fsuspect firing in the school's car park
OL,12,Fand then shooting through a window to
OL,13,Fenter.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
